elementalskill.description:
Deals <color=#FFACFFFF>Electro DMG</color> and generates an {LINK#N11360002}<color=#FFD780FF>Energy Device</color>{/LINK} in different modes, depending on whether it was tapped or held.

While the Energy Device is in Stable Mode, if a {LINK#N11360001}<color=#FFD780FF>Polestar Prism</color>{/LINK} is generated beyond the maximum number Mitya can have, that Prism will be consumed to trigger <color=#FFD780FF>Prism Surge</color>, dealing 1 instance of <color=#FFACFFFF>AoE Electro DMG</color> that is considered Stellar-Conduct reaction DMG;
When the Stable Mode Energy Device disappears, all Polestar Prisms Mitya has will be consumed to trigger <color=#FFD780FF>Prism Shatter</color>, which deals 1 instance of <color=#FFACFFFF>AoE Electro DMG</color> based on the number consumed, and is considered Stellar-Conduct reaction DMG.
